  m_Text: 'Example of using build plan and Facility Generator

    component to generate
    main corridor and set of rooms.


    All generator components provides before-generating

    scene
    view gizmos preview of what is gonna to be generated!


    Facility Generator
    is using custom code to generate multiple

    grids for FieldSetups provided
    in Build Plan and generate

    door connections between them.

    With some
    customization you can get in result game ready scenes.'
